From c1d3711e8422036fd2d8123eae5a8ccbe7976b82 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: r1metal <r1metal@localhost>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 18:21:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] power: battery, gauge, charger and PD figures of every pass
 print at debug level

- Routine lines of every pass of the charger, gauge, PD, TCPC, DLPT
  and PBM code and of every AUXADC read print at debug level.
- They print through pr_debug, dev_dbg, chr_debug, pd_dbg, bm_debug,
  mt_dbg (dbg_log_en) or TCPC_DYNDBG, a pr_debug with the TCPC prefix.
- chr_debug and pd_dbg print with pr_debug behind their level checks.
- The JEITA state line prints with chr_err only when the state changes.
- The battery's log level is BMLOG_ERROR_LEVEL from battery_psy_init
  on, so the probe prints its error lines and no debug lines.
- Three format strings get the arguments they name.
